#: synthDrivers/googleTtsForNvda/catalog.py:280
msgid ""
"Google TTS For NVDA could not be loaded because the WASM TTS Engine library "
"is incomplete.\n"
"\n"
"Reinstall Google TTS For NVDA with the complete WASM TTS Engine library."
msgstr ""
"No se pudo cargar Google TTS Para NVDA porque la biblioteca del motor WASM "
"TTS está incompleta.\n"
"\n"
"Vuelve a instalar Google TTS Para NVDA con la biblioteca completa del motor "
"WASM TTS."

#: synthDrivers/googleTtsForNvda/catalog.py:275
msgid ""
"Google TTS For NVDA could not be loaded because the WASM TTS Engine library "
"is missing.\n"
"\n"
"Reinstall Google TTS For NVDA with the included WASM TTS Engine library."
msgstr ""
"No se pudo cargar Google TTS Para NVDA porque falta la biblioteca del motor "
"WASM TTS.\n"
"\n"
"Vuelve a instalar Google TTS Para NVDA con la biblioteca incluida del motor "
"WASM TTS."

#: synthDrivers/googleTtsForNvda/catalog.py:269
msgid ""
"Google TTS For NVDA could not be loaded because the WASM TTS Engine version "
"is not supported.\n"
"\n"
"This add-on supports WASM TTS Engine version {supported}, but found: "
"{found}.\n"
"\n"
"Install a Google TTS For NVDA package that includes the supported WASM TTS "
"Engine."
msgstr ""
"No se pudo cargar Google TTS Para NVDA porque la versión del motor WASM TTS "
"no es compatible.\n"
"\n"
"Este complemento admite la versión {supported} del motor WASM TTS, pero se "
"encontró: {found}.\n"
"\n"
"Instala un paquete de Google TTS Para NVDA que incluya la versión compatible "
"del motor WASM TTS."

#: synthDrivers/googleTtsForNvda/catalog.py:284
msgid ""
"Google TTS For NVDA could not be loaded because the WASM TTS Engine voice "
"catalog could not be read.\n"
"\n"
"Reinstall Google TTS For NVDA with a supported WASM TTS Engine library."
msgstr ""
"No se pudo cargar Google TTS Para NVDA porque no se pudo leer el catálogo de "
"voces del motor WASM TTS.\n"
"\n"
"Vuelve a instalar Google TTS Para NVDA con una biblioteca compatible del "
"motor WASM TTS."

